{"title":"Marksman Pell","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level — Unclassified that attacks with unknown (unknown).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"muted\">None known</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      <p class=\"s\">Special: Captured live by the research collector; no matching static client definition was in the bundled database.</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 1 recorded drop, 118 total, 118 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×118</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bolt\" title=\"Bolt - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bolt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"arrow\" title=\"Arrow - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 3 total, 3 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/f8e0f872cc502e1dabe7.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Arrow</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×3</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"bearhide-feet\" title=\"Bearhide Feet - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/194881d2e0ebbc92b3cd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bearhide Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Unclassified: <a href=\"#/monster/pirate-captain\">Captain Corva Redmaw</a> <span class=\"muted\">(—)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/drowned-crewman\">Drowned Crewman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(—)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/pirate-bosun\">Bosun Grell</a> <span class=\"muted\">(—)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/5fef5926bbf453bb3bb7.svg\" alt=\"Marksman Pell\"></div><h3>Marksman Pell</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>18</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base —)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Unclassified</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>unknown · unknown</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>57</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>14.4</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>900</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack range</th><td>—</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}